    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Hyndman sits in the valley of Wills Creek, which cuts through Savage Mountain and Little Allegheny Mountain before turning south toward Maryland.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyndman%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first known settler, Samuel Waters, built a bridge across Wills Creek before 1800, establishing the area’s earliest infrastructure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
