      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyndman%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early Hyndman industries included brickmaking and limestone quarrying, reflecting the region’s rich natural resources.",
